abstract: >
  A Docker-based research and experimentation environment for Apache Spark
  4.2.0 and Apache Hadoop 3.5.0, using OpenJDK 17, Scala 2.13 and Python 3.12.
  It provides Spark Standalone and YARN execution, HDFS storage, JupyterLab
  notebooks with Scala/Almond and PySpark kernels, and Spark and MapReduce
  history services. The default topology consists of one master and three
  workers running as containers on a single physical host. Resource limits,
  persistent volumes and validation scripts support controlled experiments.
  Validation covers distributed execution, nine example notebooks and
  persistence across container recreation. HiBench compatibility is assessed
  separately and is outside this release's validation scope.
